File-type and folder icons from the New UI (expui) icon set of JetBrains IntelliJ Platform.

Source: https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community
Commit: 2775e0a0c688336d89062d6dbf46f79f79b99c6a (master when fetched, 2026-11-10)
Paths:  platform/icons/src/expui/fileTypes/*.svg and platform/icons/src/expui/nodes/folder.svg, each with its _dark variant where one exists
The SVG files are byte for byte the originals; each carries the header "Use of this source code is governed by the Apache 2.0 license".

License: Apache License 2.0, text in the LICENSE file next to this one. Copyright JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors.
The LICENSE file is the Apache 2.0 text from LICENSE.txt of that repository at commit 7aaea6b2d21dab83cd022a4b8f9b15658375bef0 (2024-03-04), its last revision that was the plain Apache text.
Since commit 9691014c2d11e46a999c1ff04987498589b256bb (2026-06-10) LICENSE.txt holds the "JetBrains Open-Source Build Terms", which state that the open-source parts are subject to the Apache 2.0 license.

src/ui/fileicons-data.ts embeds these SVGs as strings (frames can only import code); scripts/gen-fileicons.mjs regenerates it.
